<title>UK: Marks &amp; Spencer to add 2,000 staff this year.</title>
<headline>Marks &amp; Spencer to add 2,000 staff this year.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Marks &amp; Spencer Plc said on Tuesday it would add 2,000 staff this year in Britain, following the creation of 1,500 new jobs last year.</p>
<p>The retailer said this would inevitably increase costs, but it was essential to invest in customer service.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
